  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.13 Project parcel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.13 “Project parcel” means the real property of an owner on which the work that is the subject of the proposed action, approval, permit, or other written authorization under review has occurred or is proposed to occur.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
